{
  "title": "koylu_muhabbet_yusuf",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "node:start",
      "type": "START",
      "position": "(0.0, 0.0)"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:selam",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(350.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Yusuf",
      "text": "Greetings, master guard... I am Yusuf. I hold the rope of my dog Karabash, and I always watch the gate."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Do you never let go of that rope in your hand, Yusuf?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Provisions have dwindled in the village, winter frost sets in; are you hungry, lad?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:opt_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE_OPTION",
      "position": "(700.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Gatekeeper",
      "text": "Did you hear the decisions rendered at the gate last night; what do the folk say?"
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_normal",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, -180.0)",
      "character": "Yusuf",
      "text": "Karabash is my shepherd dog, master guard. His ears twitch at the rustle of an owl in the dark; whenever he barks, I know stranger or wolf approaches the fold."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_kriz",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 0.0)",
      "character": "Yusuf",
      "text": "Saruca Hatun gave me a bowl of hot tarhana soup yesterday evening, and Ayse Baci knitted me thick wool socks. I will not starve, master; our villagers feed me, and in return I tend the lame kid and Akca the ewe in the fold."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:rep_karar",
      "type": "DIALOGUE",
      "position": "(1050.0, 180.0)",
      "character": "Yusuf",
      "text": "I heard them, master... At the fountain the women said, 'The gatekeeper is a just man; he admitted those who deserved mercy.' If a villain had entered, Karabash would have barked; since he stayed quiet, they must be good souls."
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_normal",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, -180.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
      "action_script_ref": "res://src/diyalog/actions/koy_moral_action.gd",
      "values": [
        "2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "node:act_kriz",
      "type": "ACTION",
      "position": "(1400.0, 0.0)",
      "description": "Köy Morali",
      "action_type": "SCRIPT",
